{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Kinnect 是一款專為減重人士打造的輕量記錄工具，結合智能喝水提醒、體重趨勢與個人目標追蹤，讓日常管理更直觀。適合正在減重或希望建立健康習慣的使用者，現正限時免費，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>減重記錄與喝水提醒</h2>\n<p>介面採用 iOS 原生技術開發，運作流暢且完全無廣告。內建智能喝水計算與提醒，可自訂每日目標並定時通知；每日體重紀錄會生成變化曲線，配合 30 天趨勢圖、個人化減重目標及進度推算，讓成果一目了然。成就里程碑系統提供持續反饋，所有資料可選擇儲存在本機或個人 iCloud，保障私隱，並支援 iPhone、iPad 及 Apple Watch。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-253-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-254-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-255-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-256-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-257-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Kinnect</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T00:57:49.392669+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}